OL,3,GNEWSAMum left 'shaking and intimidated'
OL,4,Aafter son placed on Child Protection
OL,5,ARegister
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mum of a six-year-old boy with
OL,8,Fautism and severe learning disabilities
OL,9,Fsaid she has been left "shaking" and
OL,10,F"intimidated" after her son was placed
OL,11,Fon the Child Protection Register (CPR).
OL,13,FDanielle McQuillan said she does not
OL,14,Funderstand why Zac was registered after
OL,15,Fshe sought more overnight respite care
OL,16,Fto help her cope with his complex needs
OL,17,Fand to spend more time with her
OL,18,Fdaughters.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
