OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMum left 'shaking and intimidated'
OL,4,Aafter son placed on Child Protection
OL,5,ARegister
OL,6,
OL,7,FZac is non-verbal and his mum said his
OL,8,Fbehaviour can be extremely challenging,
OL,9,Fincluding stripping off his clothes and
OL,10,Frunning away when they are out.
OL,12,FThe South Eastern Health Trust, who
OL,13,Fplaced him on the register, said it
OL,14,F"cannot publicly discuss the details of
OL,15,Fany child or their family".
